# Local blob store (dataset snapshots, model artifacts, scorecards). Deliberately
# inside the repo rather than /tmp: macOS periodically sweeps aged files out of
# /tmp while leaving the directories behind, which silently strands every blob the
# database still points at.
.blobs/

